<programme start="20261120010000 +0000" stop="20261120030000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Stetson at Louisville</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Stetson Hatters visit the No. 10 Louisville Cardinals for an NCAA Division I game. Stetson suffered a 75-62 loss to Howard on November 12, 2026, while Louisville comes off a 98-78 loss to Memphis alongside guard Adrian Wooley.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261120030000 +0000" stop="20261120050000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">Women&apos;s College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">UConn at Louisville</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 7 Louisville Cardinals play the No. 4 UConn Huskies. Louisville looks to extend an undefeated start after holding Lindenwood to 35 points, while UConn relies on 11 three-pointers from a 12-point win on Nov. 9 to earn an away victory.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191292_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
