<programme start="20261120070000 +0000" stop="20261120100000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">California at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Cavaliers (4-5, 2-4 ACC) and Golden Bears (3-6, 2-4 ACC) try to snap three-game slides. Virginia won the first meeting, 31-21 in 2025. California, outscored 131-37 in its last three games, faces a sixth losing season in the past seven years.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
