<programme start="20261120220000 +0000" stop="20261121000000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Northeastern at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Northeastern Huskies (0-1) take on the Virginia Cavaliers (1-0) at John Paul Jones Arena. The Huskies look to rebound after dropping their season opener 93-85 to the Terriers, while the Cavaliers defeated the Dragons 89-60 behind Thijs De Ridder.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121000000 +0000" stop="20261121020000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Loyola (Md.) at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Loyola Maryland Greyhounds visit the No. 4 Virginia Cavaliers in NCAA Men&apos;s Basketball game at John Paul Jones Arena. Loyola Maryland enters on a two-game skid with Leo Ricketts, while Virginia defeated Maryland 87-83 on November 13.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121020000 +0000" stop="20261121040000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Marshall at North Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Marshall Thundering Herd visit the North Carolina Tar Heels in NCAA Men&apos;s Basketball game. Marshall lost 74-71 to Youngstown State on November 14, while North Carolina lost 78-70 to Georgia on November 13 alongside Terrence Brown.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
