<programme start="20261121044600 +0000" stop="20261121054600 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Miel</sub-title><desc lang="es">Dwight y Sherry se asocian con un misterioso grupo de personas para acabar con Ginny. Cuando Morgan se ofrece, inesperadamente, a ayudar, se produce una lucha de poder.</desc><credits><director>Michael Satrazemis</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor><actor>Devyn Tyler</actor></credits><date>20201108</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/1857193aa526f2d22c51105d8ed0d153b7060c37.JPEG"/></programme>
