<programme start="20261120214800 +0000" stop="20261120215500 +0000" channel="Cartoonito 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">Grizzy y los Lemmings</title><sub-title lang="es">Crab Crush</sub-title><desc lang="es">Los Lemmings se encariñan con un cangrejo en peligro de extinción en la playa y deciden darle cobijo. Se lo llevan a casa a un descontento Grizzy, que quiere ver la tele en paz.</desc><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Series/Children</category><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/Action</category><category lang="es">Series/Comedy</category><category lang="es">Children/Series</category><category lang="es">Children</category><category lang="es">Series/Animated</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.32.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E33</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/946/19660946-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
