<programme start="20261121033000 +0000" stop="20261121040000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">TrueSouth</title><sub-title lang="en">Madisonville</sub-title><desc lang="en">Allan Benton, proprietor of Benton&apos;s Smoky Mountain Country Hams in Madisonville, Tenn., cures and hickory smokes bacon and ham that have earned their place on the kitchen tables of working folks across the South, and on restaurant menus.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><category lang="en">Food</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15917551_b_v11_ab.jpg"/></programme>
