<programme start="20261121030000 +0000" stop="20261121050000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Los Angeles Kings at Toronto Maple Leafs</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Toronto Maple Leafs host the Los Angeles Kings in NHL regular-season play at Scotiabank Arena. Los Angeles have won the last two meetings, including a 7-6 thriller in April, and arrive in Toronto with a chance to take three in a row.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
