<programme start="20261121023000 +0000" stop="20261121050000 +0000" channel="Syfy US"><title lang="en">Never Let Go</title><desc lang="en">When an unspeakable evil takes over the world, the only protection for a mother and her twin sons is their house and strong bond. Needing to stay connected at all times, they tether themselves with ropes, clinging to one another and never letting go.</desc><credits><actor>Halle Berry</actor><actor>Anthony B. Jenkins</actor><actor>Percy Daggs IV</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Horror</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p27638681_v_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
